---
// Post 12 (Backtest) figure: Deflate. Inline SVG, site tokens only, no ids. Numbers come from the Python runs recorded in the post brief.
---
<figure class="atp12-deflate">
  <div class="atp12-deflate-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 362" role="img" aria-label="Bars of the Sharpe ratio that pure luck is expected to reach after N trials: 0 at 1 trial, 0.70 at 10, 1.00 at 46, 1.13 at 100, 1.37 at 500 and 1.46 at 1,000. Below each bar is the chance that an observed Sharpe of 1.5 over five years is real: 1.00, 0.96, 0.87, 0.79, 0.62 and 0.54.">
<text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>The bar a 1.5 Sharpe has to clear grows with every trial</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ngưỡng mà Sharpe 1,5 phải vượt tăng theo mỗi lần thử</tspan></text>
<line x1="200" y1="105.88235294117646" x2="860" y2="105.88235294117646" class="mutl" />
<text x="204" y="97.88235294117646" class="t13"><tspan data-lang-en>observed Sharpe 1.5 (5 years of daily data)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Sharpe quan sát 1,5 (5 năm dữ liệu ngày)</tspan></text>
<line x1="200" y1="300" x2="860" y2="300" class="ax" />
<rect x="220" y="300.0" width="70" height="2.0" rx="3" class="goldf" />
<text x="255" y="292.0" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>0.00</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>0,00</tspan></text>
<text x="255" y="322" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1</tspan></text>
<text x="255" y="344" class="t13 goldt" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>1.00</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1,00</tspan></text>
<rect x="328" y="208.9" width="70" height="91.1" rx="3" class="goldf" />
<text x="363" y="200.9" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>0.70</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>0,70</tspan></text>
<text x="363" y="322" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>10</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>10</tspan></text>
<text x="363" y="344" class="t13 goldt" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>0.96</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>0,96</tspan></text>
<rect x="436" y="170.1" width="70" height="129.9" rx="3" class="redf" />
<text x="471" y="162.1" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>1.00</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1,00</tspan></text>
<text x="471" y="322" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>46</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>46</tspan></text>
<text x="471" y="344" class="t13 redt" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>0.87</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>0,87</tspan></text>
<rect x="544" y="153.5" width="70" height="146.5" rx="3" class="redf" />
<text x="579" y="145.5" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>1.13</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1,13</tspan></text>
<text x="579" y="322" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>100</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>100</tspan></text>
<text x="579" y="344" class="t13 redt" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>0.79</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>0,79</tspan></text>
<rect x="652" y="123.4" width="70" height="176.6" rx="3" class="redf" />
<text x="687" y="115.4" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>1.36</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1,36</tspan></text>
<text x="687" y="322" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>500</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>500</tspan></text>
<text x="687" y="344" class="t13 redt" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>0.62</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>0,62</tspan></text>
<rect x="760" y="111.6" width="70" height="188.4" rx="3" class="redf" />
<text x="795" y="103.6" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>1.46</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1,46</tspan></text>
<text x="795" y="322" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>1,000</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1.000</tspan></text>
<text x="795" y="344" class="t13 redt" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>0.54</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>0,54</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="322" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>trials N</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>số lần thử N</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="344" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>chance true Sharpe &gt; 0</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>xác suất Sharpe thật &gt; 0</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Computed from the Deflated Sharpe Ratio formulas (Bailey and López de Prado, 2014) with 1,260 daily observations and normal returns. The trials' Sharpe ratios are assumed to spread like pure noise, 0.447 a year.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Tính từ công thức Deflated Sharpe Ratio (Bailey và López de Prado, 2014) với 1.260 quan sát ngày và lợi suất chuẩn. Giả định Sharpe của các lần thử phân tán như nhiễu thuần, 0,447 mỗi năm.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
